1
00:00:02,546 --> 00:00:05,958
Seven weeks have passed since we set sail from Enroth.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Slaves freed from our skirmishes with Regnan fleets talk of the turmoil in Arathia.

3
00:00:19,466 --> 00:00:22,212
I suspect their stories are true, but I

4
00:00:22,254 --> 00:00:25,000
must see the evidence with my own eyes.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,958
The ocean tides were kind enough to bury the fallen on its shores.

6
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:40,366
However, the smoking ruins of Cloudfire greeted us with nothing but destruction and a stench of death.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,000
With no survivors, only the battlefield
could tell me what happened here.

8
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:04,958
Despite the breath of devastation, the presence of Minotaurs suggests a raiding party.

9
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,000
However, the ranks were too well organized.

10
00:01:36,933 --> 00:01:39,733
This is the work of the Dungeon Overlords.

11
00:01:39,776 --> 00:01:44,734
Evidently, the wizards were prepared, but overrun nevertheless.

12
00:01:59,369 --> 00:02:03,055
These atrocities rend my heart and fuel my anger.

13
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:07,809
Arathia's banner must be respected, never disgraced.

14
00:02:17,306 --> 00:02:20,788
I think of my beloved Rowand
and my son Nikolai and how much

15
00:02:20,830 --> 00:02:24,633
further this war will carry me

16
00:02:25,157 --> 00:02:28,409
from them, but my duty is clear.

17
00:02:29,755 --> 00:02:33,998
My father's kingdom must survive.

18
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:38,006
Arathia must not fall to its enemies.

